 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? For such a small gathering, a plan in a few headings is enough. A proper agenda can get pretty boring. Perfect. A few headings like welcome, an update from each person, food and drinks, and closing is enough. You can start with a few appetizers, then a big roast for everyone. Serve it on plates, not in a buffet. Perfect. A big roast for everyone is easy when you buy it frozen. A few potatoes and carrots, a jar of lemon or vinegar, and you' good to go.",
